  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\nYour entire life, you've been told you're deathly allergic to bees. You've always had people protecting you from them, be it your mother or a hired hand. Today, one slips through and lands on your shoulder. You hear a tiny voice say \"Your Majesty, what are your orders?\"\n\n\"I really need to get more sleep. These all nighters are starting to give me hallucinations.\" you think as you shoo the bee away and dodge into the next room. You head to your Mom's study, to let her know that a bee had gotten in the house somehow. You open the door and find her sitting at her desk, with a man in a suit sitting across from her.\n\nShe is quite pale, and doesn't look happy to see the man. \"I'm sorry, but I'm afraid I can't do that.\" she says in a strained voice. WHen she notices you, she tries to change her expression and tone. \"Hello dear. This is Mr. Tomas. We've worked together before, so he stopped in to visit on his way through town. But he really needs to be going now.\"\n\nYou look at the man, and he smiles at you.",
